  "description": "Air-breathing engines with no rotating turbomachinery. Forward speed rams air into the inlet, compressing it aerodynamically. Subsonic-combustion ramjets operate from Mach 3 to about Mach 6; supersonic-combustion scramjets extend operation to Mach 12-15. Requires a rocket or turbine boost to reach ignition speed.",
